  lines:
    '|a||We all got together in Russian: собрались, разошлись':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5080
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Собраться, съехаться, разойтись, разъехаться: how с- and раз- with -ся say coming together and going apart in Russian.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 11080
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1pio3qs'
    '|a||Октя́брь. Ма́ша в Москве́, на встре́че однокла́ссников.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4560
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||По́здно но́чью она́ звони́т мне. Послу́шайте.':
