      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:5mup4i'
    '|a||Ну, как встре́ча? Мно́го однокла́ссников собрало́сь?':
