      ms: 4040
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:palbyq'
    '|a||Из Петербу́рга, из Каза́ни, из Калинингра́да, из Ло́ндона: все съе́хались в Москву́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7760
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1rd2hbq'
    '|a||В шко́ле они́ собрали́сь вме́сте. Like the -ся of мы ви́делись, lesson 141: something people do together.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9040
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1ll9ypg'
    '|a||А за́втра все разъезжа́ются, ка́ждый в свой го́род.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3880
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:aoqzug'
    '|a||So these verbs mostly need many people. With мно́го the verb is usually singular: мно́го однокла́ссников собрало́сь.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9360
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1eevdop'
    '|a||Together: собра́ться, any way; съе́хаться, from many places, by transport.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6280
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:18vaowa'
    '|a||And the imperfectives: собира́ться, съезжа́ться. Мы ча́сто собира́емся у Ни́ны Петро́вны.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7720
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:fnep0q'
    '|a||Apart: разойти́сь, on foot or any way; разъе́хаться, by transport.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6760
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:e9gb5v'
    '|a||Расходи́ться, разъезжа́ться. За́втра все разъезжа́ются.':
