      ms: 5000
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1k3dyjc'
    '|a||Before е, and я, ю, ё, the prefix takes ъ: съ-, разъ-. And раз- is spelt рас- before х: расходи́ться.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 13960
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:pja3hf'
    '|a||Но́вые слова́. Разгова́ривать: to talk, to have a conversation.':
